WEBVTT

01:39.520 --> 01:40.920
How did you get so badly hurt?

01:56.080 --> 01:57.440
On a night like this

01:58.759 --> 01:59.600
why would your family

02:00.200 --> 02:01.640
send a young lady like you

02:01.640 --> 02:02.480
out here all alone?

02:08.400 --> 02:10.520
My mother is ill.

02:11.560 --> 02:12.360
My father

02:14.280 --> 02:15.280
is tied up at the yamen.

02:16.120 --> 02:17.120
He can't get away.

02:20.440 --> 02:21.960
Leaving the search to the servants—

02:22.360 --> 02:23.000
for one thing

02:23.360 --> 02:24.200
I worry they might not

02:24.200 --> 02:25.360
recognize Rong.

02:26.120 --> 02:27.440
And also I'm worried

02:28.200 --> 02:29.400
that if anything changes

02:30.240 --> 02:31.240
I can make a decision right away.

03:13.480 --> 03:14.880
Your wound has been cleaned.

03:15.840 --> 03:16.640
Now

03:17.120 --> 03:18.040
I'll apply the medicine.

03:19.040 --> 03:19.880
Alright.

04:58.800 --> 04:59.800
Rong, are you alright?

04:59.920 --> 05:00.720
Thank goodness you're back!

05:00.720 --> 05:01.360
You're safe now.

05:01.480 --> 05:02.040
Miss Gu was worried sick.

05:02.040 --> 05:02.720
We were all so worried.

05:03.080 --> 05:04.040
We were frantic.

05:05.240 --> 05:06.440
That was so dangerous, don't you think?

05:08.160 --> 05:08.520
How is he?

05:08.520 --> 05:09.320
You're fine? No one's hurt, right?

05:09.320 --> 05:09.880
How is everything?

05:11.360 --> 05:12.120
You've been through a lot.

05:12.120 --> 05:12.800
I'm fine.

05:14.520 --> 05:15.320
Rong.

05:16.720 --> 05:17.560
Jinzhao.

05:19.240 --> 05:20.200
Keep sending people to search.

05:20.360 --> 05:20.960
Jinzhao

05:21.200 --> 05:21.560
I...

05:21.680 --> 05:23.080
How did you end up like this?

05:25.840 --> 05:26.760
What are you doing here?

05:28.120 --> 05:29.360
Lord Chen's guards

05:29.360 --> 05:29.920
found me.

05:31.720 --> 05:32.600
He sent them out

05:32.600 --> 05:33.480
last night.

05:33.760 --> 05:35.360
And they actually tracked Rong down

05:35.600 --> 05:36.480
in a village miles away.

05:37.000 --> 05:38.560
Lord Chen's men are truly capable.

05:38.880 --> 05:39.880
We searched for ages

05:40.040 --> 05:41.120
and got nowhere.

05:41.760 --> 05:42.800
What matters is you're back.

05:50.760 --> 05:52.520
I've troubled you again.

05:52.760 --> 05:54.600
No need for such formalities with me.

05:55.480 --> 05:57.600
If you ever find yourself in trouble again

05:58.080 --> 05:59.000
you can always come to me.

06:13.840 --> 06:14.440
Lord.

06:16.520 --> 06:17.120
My Lord.

06:18.680 --> 06:19.480
Wake up, Ye Xian.

06:20.760 --> 06:21.320
Ye Xian.

06:24.400 --> 06:25.440
Move away.

06:25.960 --> 06:27.360
Lord, please wake up.

06:29.920 --> 06:30.920
Where am I?

06:31.880 --> 06:32.720
You drank too much last night

06:32.880 --> 06:34.159
and slept here at the tavern again.

06:34.720 --> 06:35.680
Lord, you must get up.

06:35.680 --> 06:36.920
We need to head back to the Marquis's at once.

06:38.400 --> 06:39.200
I'm not going back.

06:39.240 --> 06:39.920
My Lord,

06:40.600 --> 06:41.640
I understand

06:42.120 --> 06:43.440
you're like this because of Miss Gu.

06:43.440 --> 06:44.760
How many times have I told you

06:46.080 --> 06:47.040
don't mention her to me.

06:47.200 --> 06:48.600
This is the last time, I swear.

06:49.200 --> 06:50.200
Mrs. Gu is gravely ill.

06:50.320 --> 06:51.000
They even posted notices yesterday

06:51.000 --> 06:52.040
seeking renowned physicians.

06:52.680 --> 06:54.040
Why are you telling me this?

06:54.800 --> 06:55.920
It's not like I have a renowned physician.

06:58.040 --> 06:59.320
Unless my master were here.

07:00.480 --> 07:01.720
But he's far away in the southwest.

07:01.880 --> 07:03.320
That's exactly what I was about to say.

07:03.600 --> 07:04.680
Mr. Xiao has returned.

07:04.960 --> 07:05.560
What?

07:06.800 --> 07:07.720
When did he get back?

07:07.720 --> 07:08.440
Just last night.

07:10.200 --> 07:10.760
Lord.

07:20.080 --> 07:20.840
Master.

07:32.159 --> 07:33.280
Greetings, Young Lord.

07:35.400 --> 07:36.360
Thank you, Young Lord

07:36.560 --> 07:37.880
for being willing to lend a hand.

07:38.159 --> 07:40.040
I am beyond grateful.

07:41.360 --> 07:42.120
Of course—

07:42.720 --> 07:44.400
My Grace always repays malice with kindness.

07:48.400 --> 07:48.960
This is

07:48.960 --> 07:50.280
the Divine Healer Xiao I told you about.

07:50.960 --> 07:51.800
He's also my master.

07:53.320 --> 07:54.400
It's an honor to meet you, Healer Xiao.

07:55.520 --> 07:56.320
Miss Gu.

07:58.240 --> 07:59.040
Right this way, please.

08:16.040 --> 08:17.280
This is the prescription

08:17.440 --> 08:18.480
from the previous physician.

08:21.320 --> 08:22.640
This prescription is fine.

08:23.200 --> 08:24.400
How long has she been taking it?

08:26.080 --> 08:28.240
About a month or so.

08:29.320 --> 08:30.400
By all accounts

08:30.400 --> 08:31.960
there should have been some improvement.

08:33.039 --> 08:34.400
Why hasn't she shown any sign of recovery?

08:35.159 --> 08:36.640
May I see the medicinal herbs?

08:37.960 --> 08:38.679
Of course.

08:39.480 --> 08:40.120
Nanny Zhao.

08:49.400 --> 08:50.560
That explains it.

08:51.160 --> 08:51.960
Master.

08:52.120 --> 08:52.960
This is...

08:53.440 --> 08:54.320
Rhubarb.

08:55.120 --> 08:55.880
Rhubarb.

08:56.000 --> 08:56.720
Rhubarb.

08:59.520 --> 09:00.560
This prescription

09:00.800 --> 09:01.760
doesn't call for rhubarb.

09:02.760 --> 09:04.240
Here lies the source of the ailment.

09:04.960 --> 09:06.080
Rhubarb is cold in nature.

09:06.600 --> 09:08.280
It's used to purge fire and cool the blood

09:08.520 --> 09:09.760
expel toxins and clear stasis.

09:10.920 --> 09:13.120
However, rhubarb is fiercely potent.

09:13.920 --> 09:15.360
Mrs. Gu is already frail

09:15.680 --> 09:16.840
with a weak and cold spleen and stomach.

09:17.280 --> 09:18.240
The medicine she needs

09:18.240 --> 09:19.600
works in the opposite direction of rhubarb.

09:20.040 --> 09:21.640
If taken over a long period

09:22.000 --> 09:23.680
I fear it could be fatal.

09:29.080 --> 09:30.760
If the prescription is sound,

09:31.760 --> 09:32.920
the herbs must have been tampered with.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.040
It seems

09:35.520 --> 09:37.120
someone has been adding rhubarb

09:37.120 --> 09:37.960
to the prescription.

09:41.080 --> 09:41.880
Mrs. Gu's medicine—

09:42.280 --> 09:43.240
who usually picks it up?

09:43.600 --> 09:44.400
Miss Gu,

09:44.920 --> 09:46.560
we always send someone from the General Services

09:46.720 --> 09:48.320
to take the prescription to the pharmacy.

09:49.080 --> 09:50.040
When it comes back, they hand it to me

09:50.040 --> 09:50.720
or Molan.

09:51.320 --> 09:51.920
As for brewing it

09:51.920 --> 09:52.880
Molan and I

09:52.880 --> 09:53.680
take turns watching over it.

09:58.480 --> 09:59.360
About this matter—

09:59.520 --> 10:00.920
not a single word is to leave this room.

10:01.680 --> 10:02.640
Yes,  Miss Gu.

10:03.280 --> 10:04.120
If Lord Gu

10:04.120 --> 10:05.080
or Rong should ask

10:05.240 --> 10:06.880
just say we consulted a new physician

10:07.160 --> 10:08.280
and he found nothing unusual either.

10:08.760 --> 10:09.360
Understood?

10:09.600 --> 10:10.200
Understood.

10:12.720 --> 10:13.640
Divine Healer Xiao.

10:14.400 --> 10:15.400
Given how things stand

10:15.760 --> 10:17.520
please speak plainly with me.

10:18.440 --> 10:19.240
My mother—

10:21.680 --> 10:23.480
can she still be cured?

10:24.160 --> 10:25.680
Recovery is not difficult.

10:26.400 --> 10:29.040
But the root lies in excessive worry and rumination

10:29.240 --> 10:30.280
which have turned into an ailment.

10:31.320 --> 10:33.280
If she cannot open up her heart

10:33.880 --> 10:35.160
even a temporary recovery

10:35.560 --> 10:36.840
would be like water without a source

10:37.280 --> 10:38.760
a tree without roots.

10:50.680 --> 10:51.400
Gu Jinzhao.

10:53.080 --> 10:53.880
What's on your mind?

10:54.320 --> 10:55.040
Will you investigate?

10:55.840 --> 10:56.600
Of course I will.

10:56.920 --> 10:58.440
And I'll get to the bottom of it.

11:00.200 --> 11:01.080
I knew you'd say that.

11:01.680 --> 11:02.320
So—

11:02.600 --> 11:03.320
do you have the people for it?

11:03.720 --> 11:04.440
If not

11:04.640 --> 11:05.880
I can lend you Li Xianhuai.

11:06.680 --> 11:07.520
Not just yet.

11:09.320 --> 11:10.880
This time I definitely won't do anything rash.

11:12.200 --> 11:13.520
So don't overthink it.

11:13.760 --> 11:15.040
I have to find the culprit first

11:15.200 --> 11:16.520
and then I'll trouble you for help.

11:18.200 --> 11:19.400
You've got it all figured out.

11:19.920 --> 11:20.520
Fine then.

11:20.880 --> 11:21.520
I'm off.

11:24.120 --> 11:24.800
Ye Xian.

11:34.200 --> 11:35.080
Thank you.

11:56.520 --> 11:57.480
Miss Gu, honestly—

11:57.960 --> 11:59.080
Since you've run into him anyway

11:59.480 --> 12:00.880
why are you hiding over here?

12:01.280 --> 12:02.520
Even just greeting Young Lord

12:02.520 --> 12:03.720
would have been the proper thing to do.

12:15.400 --> 12:16.480
What's there to see?

12:17.120 --> 12:18.680
Young Lord has eyes only for Jinzhao.

12:18.880 --> 12:20.080
He doesn't even notice anyone else.

12:20.920 --> 12:22.520
I've no desire to make a fool of myself again.

12:34.240 --> 12:35.400
Luo Liu, go.

12:35.760 --> 12:36.600
Quickly, take this prescription

12:36.600 --> 12:37.160
and get the herbs.

12:37.160 --> 12:37.560
Yes.

12:39.680 --> 12:40.840
Hurry, hurry up.

12:41.360 --> 12:43.000
Sir, your medicine is ready.

12:44.200 --> 12:44.960
Take care now.

12:49.880 --> 12:51.000
What took you so long?

12:51.760 --> 12:52.960
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

12:53.320 --> 12:53.960
Where is it?

13:11.080 --> 13:11.680
Look.

13:12.040 --> 13:13.560
Just as I thought—rhubarb in every packet.

13:14.080 --> 13:14.680
That concubine Song

13:14.680 --> 13:15.840
truly has a vicious heart.

13:18.160 --> 13:19.160
You saw it all clearly?

13:20.160 --> 13:21.120
Crystal clear.

13:21.720 --> 13:22.800
It was from Concubine Song's quarters—

13:22.800 --> 13:23.800
Liuxiang and Luo Liu.

13:27.920 --> 13:29.440
Ah, this wine...

13:42.760 --> 13:44.400
This girl's quite something.

14:10.480 --> 14:11.520
Thank you for your help, Guard Li.

14:11.920 --> 14:13.720
Please, on behalf of my lady

14:13.720 --> 14:15.040
convey a message to Young Lord.

14:16.520 --> 14:17.600
Just frighten them a bit

14:18.000 --> 14:18.920
no need for actual punishment.

14:19.440 --> 14:20.360
I understand, sir.

14:25.000 --> 14:26.320
Before the midday meal

14:26.760 --> 14:29.000
Mrs. Mu paid a sudden visit.

14:30.080 --> 14:32.440
She came about her eldest son's marriage.

14:32.680 --> 14:33.480
Mu Zhidi.

14:33.720 --> 14:34.080
Yes.

14:34.680 --> 14:37.240
That tall, dull-witted one.

14:37.480 --> 14:38.760
Xuanqing's classmate.

14:41.120 --> 14:43.600
This rose dew is so fresh and sweet.

14:43.760 --> 14:44.520
Have a taste.

14:44.760 --> 14:45.360
Alright.

14:47.000 --> 14:49.160
So this Mu Zhidi and the marriage proposal—

14:49.400 --> 14:50.520
what did she say to you?

14:51.920 --> 14:52.720
Could it be

14:53.120 --> 14:54.400
she's taken a liking to our Yanying?

14:54.640 --> 14:55.800
Not Yanying.

14:55.800 --> 14:56.960
It's Miss Gu.

14:58.240 --> 15:00.600
It was last year, during the chrysanthemum viewing.

15:01.200 --> 15:02.720
He seemed perfectly quiet at the time

15:03.280 --> 15:04.800
but apparently he'd already fallen for her.

15:05.840 --> 15:07.840
They say from that very day

15:08.080 --> 15:09.560
he couldn't get her out of his mind.

15:10.440 --> 15:11.720
Then a few days ago

15:12.120 --> 15:14.880
when the family brought up arranging his marriage

15:16.240 --> 15:18.440
he could no longer hold it in and confessed.

15:18.960 --> 15:21.280
When the Mus heard she's a daughter of a concubine

15:22.040 --> 15:23.560
they said absolutely not.

15:24.320 --> 15:25.040
What do you mean?

15:25.160 --> 15:25.760
A concubine's daughter?

15:26.160 --> 15:27.960
The second daughter of the Gu family.

15:28.280 --> 15:29.320
The one they call Lan.

15:29.720 --> 15:32.200
Born of a concubine, indeed.

15:33.880 --> 15:35.920
But that Mu Zhidi, of all people

15:35.920 --> 15:37.240
is a stubborn romantic.

15:38.240 --> 15:39.440
He actually put on

15:39.600 --> 15:42.000
a "I'll marry no one but the Lan" act.

15:42.880 --> 15:44.760
Mrs. Mu was at her wits' end

15:45.120 --> 15:47.240
so she came around asking questions

15:47.760 --> 15:48.960
wanting to find out

15:49.360 --> 15:50.960
what sort of person

15:50.960 --> 15:53.320
this Lan really is.

15:54.160 --> 15:55.560
Honestly, that Mrs. Mu

15:55.560 --> 15:56.840
has no sense of direction at all.

15:57.720 --> 16:00.120
She went on and on about the Lan

16:01.320 --> 16:04.080
then suddenly started asking about Jinzhao as well.

16:06.200 --> 16:06.960
Go on, eat.

16:09.880 --> 16:10.720
I've had enough.

16:12.040 --> 16:13.760
Why is she asking around about Jinzhao?

16:14.160 --> 16:15.080
She says

16:15.560 --> 16:18.160
she's heard Jinzhao is a great beauty

16:19.080 --> 16:20.480
with a generous dowry

16:20.720 --> 16:22.000
and the firstborn of the lawful wife.

16:23.360 --> 16:25.800
A perfect match for their Mu Zhidi.

16:26.960 --> 16:27.680
And since

16:27.680 --> 16:29.880
I have a connection with Old Mrs. Ji

16:30.560 --> 16:32.800
she wanted to ask me to play matchmaker.

16:34.560 --> 16:35.520
Tell me—

16:36.040 --> 16:38.240
is this match suitable or not?

16:38.440 --> 16:39.440
It's not.

16:39.960 --> 16:41.680
The Mu Zhidi clearly has his eye on

16:41.680 --> 16:42.560
the Lan.

16:42.720 --> 16:44.000
But Mrs. Mu is trying to twist it

16:44.000 --> 16:44.880
into the eldest Miss Gu.

16:45.480 --> 16:46.760
What status does she think her family holds?

16:46.960 --> 16:48.160
And what does she take the Gu family for?

16:48.600 --> 16:49.720
It's utterly absurd.

16:51.920 --> 16:52.680
This matter—

16:53.040 --> 16:53.640
you needn't

16:53.640 --> 16:54.720
bring it up with Mrs. Ji.

16:55.240 --> 16:55.840
It would only

16:56.360 --> 16:57.400
upset people for no good reason.

16:57.640 --> 17:00.280
I'm consulting you first, aren't I?

17:01.200 --> 17:03.600
And I wasn't really going to do it.

17:04.119 --> 17:04.920
That's fine then.

17:06.200 --> 17:07.440
I have other matters to attend to.

17:07.839 --> 17:08.839
I'll take my leave now.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.280
Please enjoy your meal, Mother.

17:17.079 --> 17:18.560
What's gotten into him?

17:18.880 --> 17:19.880
From what I can tell

17:20.040 --> 17:21.599
He seems angered.

17:21.920 --> 17:24.200
That much I've noticed myself.

17:24.960 --> 17:26.400
But what is he angry about?

17:31.360 --> 17:31.960
Lord.

17:34.120 --> 17:35.520
Go and discreetly find out

17:35.960 --> 17:37.800
what's really going on with the Mu family

17:37.800 --> 17:38.880
proposing to the Gu household.

17:40.600 --> 17:41.040
Yes.

17:54.400 --> 17:55.080
Help!

17:55.560 --> 17:56.960
Help!

18:07.720 --> 18:08.600
Speak.

18:09.640 --> 18:11.040
How did you slip the drug

18:11.040 --> 18:12.120
to poison your mistress?

18:12.800 --> 18:14.160
Confess truthfully.

18:17.600 --> 18:19.000
I did no such thing!

18:21.880 --> 18:23.120
Still trying to deny it?

18:24.920 --> 18:26.560
Luo Liu has already confessed everything.

18:27.720 --> 18:30.240
He said you told him to add rhubarb to the medicine.

18:30.240 --> 18:31.240
I didn't!

18:31.240 --> 18:31.960
Then who?

18:39.320 --> 18:40.640
It was Nanny Zhou.

18:41.680 --> 18:43.200
Nanny Zhou told me

18:43.440 --> 18:45.120
to give the herbs to Luo Liu.

18:54.320 --> 18:54.960
Lord.

18:55.880 --> 18:56.360
They confessed.

18:56.560 --> 18:57.440
Both of them confessed fully.

18:57.640 --> 18:58.560
We didn't even have time to frighten them.

18:58.680 --> 18:59.440
They just spilled everything.

19:09.320 --> 19:09.840
Let's go.

19:10.080 --> 19:10.760
To find Gu Jinzhao.

19:10.840 --> 19:11.200
Yes.

19:11.280 --> 19:12.120
The Marquis arrives!

19:45.800 --> 19:46.760
Greetings, Your Lordship.

19:52.400 --> 19:53.880
I heard you've seized two people

19:54.240 --> 19:56.000
and set up your own private court here.

19:57.960 --> 19:58.520
Helping a friend

19:58.520 --> 19:59.560
interrogate a couple of household servants, that's all.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.280
No torture was used.

20:24.960 --> 20:27.000
What utter nonsense.

20:27.440 --> 20:29.360
Which one of your lowlife friends is it this time?

20:30.880 --> 20:32.720
Even if I told you, you wouldn't know them.

20:33.240 --> 20:34.280
And if I pointed them out

20:34.840 --> 20:35.920
your arm wouldn't reach that far.

20:36.560 --> 20:37.200
Insolence!

20:38.760 --> 20:40.000
Just looking at this confession

20:40.280 --> 20:42.080
it's clearly one of those degenerate households

20:42.080 --> 20:43.720
with corrupt morals and low breeding.

20:44.880 --> 20:46.240
You spend your days carousing with them

20:46.240 --> 20:47.080
stirring up trouble.

20:47.520 --> 20:48.520
Do you not care about your future at all?

20:50.400 --> 20:52.320
You make it sound as if I'd have a future

20:52.680 --> 20:53.440
if I stopped carousing

20:53.440 --> 20:54.360
and stirring up trouble.

20:55.840 --> 20:56.360
Lord.

20:56.960 --> 20:57.480
My Lord.

20:57.480 --> 20:58.240
Sir, please calm yourself down.

20:58.520 --> 20:59.960
Young master spoke in a moment of anger.

21:01.480 --> 21:02.840
He doesn't need you to plead his case.

21:03.960 --> 21:05.000
I know exactly what he is

21:05.000 --> 21:06.120
better than anyone.

21:06.840 --> 21:07.440
Guards.

21:08.360 --> 21:09.320
Keep an eye on this brat.

21:09.600 --> 21:10.720
Without my express order

21:11.240 --> 21:13.080
he is not to take a single step beyond the Marquis's gates.

21:13.280 --> 21:13.920
As you command.

21:17.240 --> 21:17.960
Master Xiao.

21:18.200 --> 21:18.960
Come with me.

21:19.720 --> 21:20.600
I have something to ask you.

21:21.080 --> 21:21.680
Yes.

21:32.840 --> 21:34.400
What you said just now is true?

21:35.560 --> 21:37.080
I practiced medicine in the southwest for many years.

21:37.520 --> 21:38.840
I saved the lives of several bandits.

21:39.560 --> 21:40.840
They would not keep the truth from me.

21:41.760 --> 21:43.640
Their leader told me himself

21:44.560 --> 21:46.040
that their entire families

21:46.400 --> 21:47.440
are held hostage by Prince Glorian.

21:47.880 --> 21:49.360
He forced them to assassinate the Crown Prince.

21:53.400 --> 21:55.280
Without Prince Glorian working from the inside

21:55.400 --> 21:56.800
those bandits could never

21:56.800 --> 21:59.120
have concealed themselves in the capital for so long—

21:59.680 --> 22:01.680
let alone learn the Crown Prince's movements.

22:02.160 --> 22:03.040
Years ago,

22:03.560 --> 22:05.280
I believed that eliminating Prince Chengqing

22:05.360 --> 22:06.440
would mean Prince Glorian—

22:06.440 --> 22:08.080
his brother from the same mother—

22:09.120 --> 22:10.880
would surely not remain either.

22:11.680 --> 22:13.760
But His Majesty, in his mercy, spared him.

22:20.760 --> 22:21.600
From this day forward

22:21.800 --> 22:22.840
set aside all other tasks.

22:22.960 --> 22:25.160
Focus solely on surveilling Prince Glorian's residence in secret.

22:25.400 --> 22:26.520
At the first sign of trouble

22:26.720 --> 22:28.080
report it to me immediately.

22:28.960 --> 22:30.640
What is it that worries You?

22:36.200 --> 22:37.280
His Majesty is gravely ill.

22:37.840 --> 22:39.120
I fear that rogue

22:39.400 --> 22:40.400
will try something.

22:41.760 --> 22:43.080
Xiaoyou understands.

23:05.400 --> 23:06.600
You've worked hard.

23:07.640 --> 23:09.360
Lan, you too.

23:09.520 --> 23:10.520
I didn't do much, Mother.

23:10.800 --> 23:12.120
Jinzhao did all the real work.

23:12.520 --> 23:13.600
The Divine Healer Xiao this time—

23:13.600 --> 23:14.440
she's the one who brought him here.

23:15.160 --> 23:16.800
Those days you were unconscious

23:16.960 --> 23:18.920
Jinzhao watched over you day and night.

23:19.240 --> 23:20.680
She's only just gone to rest a little.

23:22.720 --> 23:24.000
You are both good children.

23:25.120 --> 23:26.240
All of this for me.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.560
I am fine now.

23:28.960 --> 23:30.120
Go and get some rest yourselves.

23:30.680 --> 23:31.520
Off you go now.

23:44.320 --> 23:45.880
What's written here—

23:46.560 --> 23:47.680
is it all true?

23:47.880 --> 23:49.360
Signed, sealed, everything in order.

23:49.760 --> 23:50.800
If you don't believe it,

23:51.160 --> 23:52.000
the culprits are tied up right here.

23:52.240 --> 23:53.520
You can question them again yourself.

23:54.200 --> 23:55.080
Guards.

23:56.800 --> 23:57.920
Bring Concubine Song

23:57.920 --> 23:59.720
and Nanny Zhou here.

24:00.120 --> 24:00.720
Yes.

24:06.400 --> 24:07.280
This here—

24:08.280 --> 24:09.840
your favorite pigeon soup.

24:10.040 --> 24:11.400
I simmered it a full four hours.

24:11.920 --> 24:12.800
Have at least a little.

24:16.680 --> 24:17.320
Here.

24:17.560 --> 24:18.400
My Lady.

24:18.480 --> 24:19.400
Concubine Song.

24:20.920 --> 24:22.280
Nanny Zhou was taken to the front courtyard

24:22.280 --> 24:23.600
by the Master's men.

24:24.240 --> 24:25.840
Why would the Master take Nanny Zhou?

24:25.960 --> 24:27.000
I don't know.

24:27.000 --> 24:28.400
I only saw a few old serving women

24:28.400 --> 24:29.480
dragging Nanny Zhou away

24:29.480 --> 24:30.720
fierce as demons.

24:30.720 --> 24:31.840
It didn't look good at all.

24:34.640 --> 24:36.360
What has Nanny Zhou done this time?

24:38.680 --> 24:39.280
Mother.

24:40.000 --> 24:40.520
Mother.

24:41.440 --> 24:42.760
You know something, don't you?

24:45.000 --> 24:45.640
No, I don't.

24:46.760 --> 24:48.240
Is Concubine Song here?

24:49.440 --> 24:50.040
Lan.

24:50.400 --> 24:51.000
Lan.

24:52.840 --> 24:54.360
Ziling, go and stop them.

24:54.480 --> 24:55.240
Don't let them in.

24:55.240 --> 24:56.160
Yes, My Lady.

25:02.200 --> 25:03.280
What's really going on?

25:05.000 --> 25:06.080
Say something.

25:06.640 --> 25:07.360
Lan, I...

25:14.160 --> 25:14.520
Move aside.

25:24.960 --> 25:26.280
You can read.

25:26.880 --> 25:28.720
Luo Liu and Liuxiang have both confessed.

25:29.800 --> 25:31.160
They say you put them up to it.

25:32.360 --> 25:33.800
Do you admit it or not?

25:37.800 --> 25:38.680
I admit it.

25:39.440 --> 25:40.160
Everything

25:40.840 --> 25:42.200
was all done at my bidding.

25:43.120 --> 25:44.920
How utterly vicious.

25:45.920 --> 25:47.280
What did the Mistress ever do to you

25:47.640 --> 25:48.520
that you could commit

25:48.520 --> 25:50.960
such a heinous, unhinged act?

25:51.240 --> 25:52.400
Lord Gu,

25:53.360 --> 25:53.800
Nanny Zhou

25:53.800 --> 25:54.960
is nothing but a lowly servant.

25:55.600 --> 25:57.120
What grudge could she possibly hold against the Mistress?

25:57.360 --> 25:58.680
She had to be acting on someone's orders.

25:58.800 --> 25:59.960
Ms. Jinzhao, don't make reckless accusations.

26:00.600 --> 26:01.440
No one put me up to it.

26:01.760 --> 26:02.560
It was all

26:02.560 --> 26:03.640
my decision alone.

26:04.480 --> 26:05.160
Lord Gu.

26:05.360 --> 26:07.080
Concubine Song is just outside.

26:07.080 --> 26:07.960
Bring her in.

26:08.200 --> 26:08.800
Qingpu.

26:09.240 --> 26:09.960
Gag her.

26:10.120 --> 26:10.560
Yes.

26:31.280 --> 26:31.920
Lord Gu.

26:32.240 --> 26:33.000
What is all this?

26:33.000 --> 26:33.720
Such a grand commotion.

26:33.720 --> 26:35.440
You know perfectly well what this is about, don't you?

26:35.960 --> 26:36.440
I—

26:37.960 --> 26:39.040
I don't understand.

26:39.840 --> 26:40.720
Then let me ask you.

26:41.960 --> 26:44.200
Nanny Zhou instructed Liuxiang

26:44.480 --> 26:47.200
to pass the rhubarb to Luo Liu

26:47.200 --> 26:49.000
to mix into the Madam's medicine.

26:49.760 --> 26:52.400
Were you the one behind it?

26:56.240 --> 26:57.040
Listen to me.

26:57.520 --> 26:59.320
From beginning to end—

26:59.320 --> 27:00.240
you knew nothing about this.

27:00.640 --> 27:01.360
What medicine?

27:01.480 --> 27:03.200
What… what Luo Liu?

27:03.560 --> 27:04.280
It was all Nanny Zhou

27:04.280 --> 27:05.040
and the people she hired.

27:05.600 --> 27:06.280
No matter where you are—

27:06.520 --> 27:07.920
even if you end up before the Shuntian Prefecture—

27:08.240 --> 27:10.120
you must say, that from start to finish

27:10.120 --> 27:11.120
you knew absolutely nothing.

27:13.000 --> 27:13.880
Lan, but I—

27:13.880 --> 27:14.840
No "buts."

27:15.200 --> 27:16.560
We are at a critical juncture now.

27:17.600 --> 27:18.720
Do you want to die?

27:20.600 --> 27:21.720
Think of me!

27:22.320 --> 27:23.920
If you die, what will become of me?

27:24.240 --> 27:24.880
Mother.

27:25.640 --> 27:27.320
Think of me—please, think of me.

27:29.840 --> 27:31.240
I wasn't the one behind it, Lord Gu.

27:31.560 --> 27:32.360
I know nothing about it.

27:32.480 --> 27:33.200
Is that so?

27:35.040 --> 27:36.800
But Nanny Zhou just confessed.

27:37.200 --> 27:38.720
She said it was you who gave the order.

27:42.920 --> 27:43.800
She's lying!

27:43.920 --> 27:44.720
Lying?

27:46.040 --> 27:47.200
Why would she lie?

27:47.960 --> 27:48.880
She plotted against the Madam

27:49.040 --> 27:50.120
and it was all because of you, wasn't it?

27:50.760 --> 27:51.680
Liuxiang—

27:51.680 --> 27:52.480
Nanny Zhou—

27:52.760 --> 27:54.120
both of them are from your own quarters.

27:54.760 --> 27:56.360
And you dare claim you knew nothing

27:56.480 --> 27:57.480
about any of this?

27:57.840 --> 27:58.800
Ms. Jinzhao.

27:59.080 --> 28:00.520
I truly knew nothing.

28:00.640 --> 28:01.680
Still clinging to your story?

28:03.440 --> 28:05.040
Then we'll have to take this to the Shuntian Prefecture.

28:17.640 --> 28:19.600
Nanny Zhou was your wet nurse.

28:20.080 --> 28:22.080
Liuxiang was your personal maid.

28:22.440 --> 28:23.520
They committed such

28:23.520 --> 28:24.640
utterly villainous acts

28:24.640 --> 28:25.920
and yet you claim to know nothing?

28:26.040 --> 28:27.880
How utterly foolish can you be?

28:28.720 --> 28:29.920
From now on, you are not to leave your quarters.

28:30.120 --> 28:32.280
Confine yourself and reflect upon your misdeeds.

28:32.280 --> 28:32.800
Lord Gu

28:33.000 --> 28:34.000
As for the rest of you—

28:34.000 --> 28:34.760
Liuxiang.

28:35.240 --> 28:35.920
Luo Liu.

28:36.880 --> 28:38.600
Forty strokes each.

28:38.720 --> 28:39.400
When that's done

28:40.040 --> 28:41.640
throw them onto the estate for hard labor.

28:41.920 --> 28:42.600
Nanny Zhou.

28:43.280 --> 28:44.560
Sixty strokes.

28:44.560 --> 28:45.880
Make every stroke count.

28:45.880 --> 28:46.280
Lord Gu.

28:46.440 --> 28:48.280
Send her to the estate as well when it's over.

28:48.280 --> 28:49.000
A moment, Lord Gu.

28:50.160 --> 28:51.720
She nearly drove the Madam to her death.

28:51.720 --> 28:53.320
And her punishment is merely confinement?

28:53.480 --> 28:54.920
Did Nanny Zhou not just say

28:55.680 --> 28:57.440
that she alone was behind it all?

28:57.440 --> 28:59.960
Concubine Song knew nothing of it.

28:59.960 --> 29:01.120
Those words you just spoke—

29:01.280 --> 29:02.320
do you even believe them yourself?

29:03.000 --> 29:03.520
Nanny Zhou

29:03.520 --> 29:04.920
slipped rhubarb into the Madam's medicine

29:05.560 --> 29:06.840
all because of Concubine Song, did she not?

29:07.360 --> 29:08.640
Liuxiang already confessed

29:09.120 --> 29:10.520
that since the tenth month of last year

29:11.000 --> 29:12.800
they have been tampering with the Madam's medicine.

29:13.280 --> 29:14.480
All this time

29:14.720 --> 29:15.360
Concubine Song—

29:15.360 --> 29:16.720
how could she possibly know nothing?

29:16.800 --> 29:18.040
And what of it?

29:18.800 --> 29:19.760
In judgment and in household governance

29:19.920 --> 29:21.240
one cannot rely on mere supposition.

29:21.800 --> 29:23.360
You go on about the Shuntian Prefecture—

29:24.520 --> 29:25.640
but in Liuxiang's deposition

29:25.640 --> 29:26.560
there is no mention of Concubine Song.

29:26.720 --> 29:27.760
Nanny Zhou, too, says

29:27.760 --> 29:29.240
Concubine Song knew nothing.

29:29.520 --> 29:30.560
Since there is no proof

29:31.320 --> 29:32.880
even the Shuntian Prefecture

29:32.880 --> 29:34.560
could only rule the same way.

29:35.400 --> 29:36.680
Since you say there is no proof

29:37.520 --> 29:38.280
then I will go now

29:38.280 --> 29:39.240
and search Concubine Song's quarters.

29:39.640 --> 29:40.680
I refuse to believe I won't find something.

29:40.920 --> 29:41.640
Qingpu—and Nanny Zhou—

29:41.640 --> 29:42.200
we're leaving.

29:42.720 --> 29:43.440
Yes, My Lady.

29:43.440 --> 29:43.920
You—

29:50.200 --> 29:51.240
What are you standing there for?

29:51.640 --> 29:52.520
Drag them away, quickly.

29:52.920 --> 29:54.240
Lord Gu, Lord Gu.

29:54.640 --> 29:55.480
Lord Gu, you mustn't!

29:55.480 --> 29:56.040
Sixty strokes

29:56.040 --> 29:57.240
will be the death of Nanny Zhou!

29:57.240 --> 29:57.920
Lord Gu

29:57.920 --> 29:59.120
I beg you, Lord Gu!

29:59.120 --> 30:00.400
Can't bear to part with Nanny Zhou?

30:00.880 --> 30:02.000
Perhaps you'd like to join her?

30:02.640 --> 30:03.720
Think of your daughter Lan.

30:03.840 --> 30:04.520
For goodness' sake.

30:05.320 --> 30:06.080
Take them away now.

30:13.120 --> 30:14.520
What are we going to do?

30:20.600 --> 30:21.560
Concubine Song's quarters—

30:21.680 --> 30:22.640
there's probably nothing there.

30:24.160 --> 30:25.200
Should we still go, then?

30:26.520 --> 30:27.320
You go ahead.

30:27.600 --> 30:29.000
I'll make one more attempt to probe Concubine Song.

30:49.880 --> 30:51.160
What do you want now?

30:51.280 --> 30:51.880
Nanny Zhou

30:51.880 --> 30:53.440
slipped rhubarb into the Madam's medicine.

30:54.280 --> 30:55.360
You knew all along—

30:55.840 --> 30:57.000
you were the one who ordered it.

30:57.840 --> 30:58.520
Weren't you?

30:58.720 --> 30:59.360
No.

31:01.040 --> 31:02.000
I don't know anything.

31:03.600 --> 31:04.520
Nanny Zhou

31:05.160 --> 31:06.240
has been sentenced to sixty strokes.

31:07.360 --> 31:08.800
On the estate, there is little medicine and no proper care—

31:09.480 --> 31:10.360
it is very likely

31:10.720 --> 31:12.120
she may never come back from this.

31:14.280 --> 31:16.080
If you are willing to tell the truth

31:17.440 --> 31:18.760
I can guarantee she will survive.

31:20.520 --> 31:22.280
You and Nanny Zhou are as close as mother and daughter.

31:23.280 --> 31:24.440
Everything she did

31:25.120 --> 31:26.080
was for your sake.

31:27.040 --> 31:28.080
Can you truly bear

31:28.680 --> 31:30.440
to watch her go to her death?

31:33.960 --> 31:34.760
Gu Jinzhao.

31:37.040 --> 31:37.680
Lan.

31:38.280 --> 31:39.600
My mother knows nothing.

31:39.840 --> 31:40.680
She did nothing.

31:40.680 --> 31:41.640
Nothing at all.

31:41.640 --> 31:42.360
Then why so defensive?

31:43.000 --> 31:43.960
I am not defensive.

31:44.480 --> 31:45.680
It's you who won't stop hounding us.

31:45.920 --> 31:46.760
You know full well

31:46.920 --> 31:47.760
that Nanny Zhou will never

31:47.760 --> 31:48.640
come back in this lifetime.

31:49.120 --> 31:50.320
Why are you still not satisfied?

31:51.040 --> 31:52.480
What exactly do you want?

31:53.040 --> 31:54.560
My mother is Father's concubine.

31:54.840 --> 31:55.800
How she is to be dealt with

31:55.920 --> 31:57.160
is for Father alone to decide.

31:57.600 --> 31:58.920
There's no need for you to usurp that authority.

31:59.280 --> 32:00.080
Lan.

32:03.320 --> 32:04.040
Ms. Jinzhao.

32:04.360 --> 32:05.800
I truly know nothing.

32:06.120 --> 32:07.120
You are overthinking this.

32:07.400 --> 32:08.080
Mother.

32:08.800 --> 32:09.680
No need to explain to her.

32:10.120 --> 32:11.040
This household—

32:11.320 --> 32:13.000
she is not yet the one in charge.

32:19.520 --> 32:20.160
Ms. Jinzhao

32:22.000 --> 32:23.440
We found nothing at all.

32:26.880 --> 32:27.720
Are you alright?

32:29.600 --> 32:30.160
I'm fine.

32:32.760 --> 32:33.760
I was just thinking

32:34.680 --> 32:35.960
about what Gu Lan said.

32:37.440 --> 32:38.360
She was right.

32:39.200 --> 32:40.040
This household

32:41.000 --> 32:42.360
Is indeed not mine to rule.

32:44.720 --> 32:45.880
But so what?

32:47.840 --> 32:49.520
Regardless of who holds sway over this house

32:50.960 --> 32:52.960
the truth between right and wrong can never be overturned.

32:56.560 --> 32:57.560
Lord Gu is inside.

32:58.520 --> 33:00.520
Nanny Zhou received sixty strokes

33:01.120 --> 33:02.440
and has been banished to the estate.

33:03.240 --> 33:05.200
She likely won't last much longer.

33:05.960 --> 33:06.880
That counts as

33:07.280 --> 33:08.520
avenging you, in a way.

33:10.360 --> 33:11.520
And what of Song Miaohua?

33:12.440 --> 33:15.240
Concubine Song genuinely knew nothing.

33:15.600 --> 33:17.280
It was all at Nanny Zhou's instigation.

33:20.840 --> 33:22.880
I'd like to ask you for a favor.

33:24.720 --> 33:26.080
Concubine Song is, after all

33:26.080 --> 33:27.560
Lan's mother.

33:28.400 --> 33:29.680
Even setting her aside

33:30.160 --> 33:31.040
we must at least

33:31.400 --> 33:33.240
consider Lan's standing, mustn't we?

33:36.520 --> 33:38.320
In the end, Lord Gu still cannot bear to part with her.

33:40.240 --> 33:41.640
It's no wonder Song Miaohua

33:41.640 --> 33:43.120
gave up even her own parents back then

33:43.960 --> 33:45.400
just to be with His Lordship.

33:45.960 --> 33:46.520
Oh, you.

33:47.240 --> 33:49.160
I'm speaking with you calmly, aren't I?

33:56.320 --> 33:57.240
It's getting late.

33:57.400 --> 33:58.160
You should rest now.

34:16.480 --> 34:17.239
Madam.

34:18.840 --> 34:20.080
I owe you everything this time.

34:22.880 --> 34:24.239
They told me what happened.

34:24.840 --> 34:25.840
If not for you

34:26.679 --> 34:28.040
I might have truly

34:28.719 --> 34:29.520
this time

34:29.520 --> 34:31.040
been killed by Song Miaohua.

34:31.679 --> 34:32.520
Don't dwell on any of that.

34:32.520 --> 34:33.400
Put those matters aside.

34:34.120 --> 34:35.199
What matters most right now

34:35.679 --> 34:36.880
is that you focus on recovering in peace.

34:37.920 --> 34:39.120
I'll take care of everything else.

34:49.239 --> 34:50.199
You may all leave us.

34:50.480 --> 34:51.840
I have something to say to Nanny Zhou.

34:58.960 --> 34:59.960
Lan.

35:02.640 --> 35:03.440
Nanny Zhou.

35:04.600 --> 35:06.040
My mother has been confined.

35:06.320 --> 35:07.240
She can't come out.

35:08.280 --> 35:09.520
I came on her behalf to see you.

35:11.360 --> 35:12.400
It's better this way.

35:14.640 --> 35:16.040
That you've come to send me off—

35:17.600 --> 35:19.120
it makes me glad, too.

35:20.040 --> 35:21.800
But now that I'm leaving

35:22.200 --> 35:24.280
you must take good care of your mother.

35:26.040 --> 35:29.600
I truly fear she'll suffer without me.

35:33.280 --> 35:34.720
I'll take good care of her.

35:35.720 --> 35:36.840
Don't worry.

35:38.440 --> 35:39.400
Little Blackbird.

35:39.400 --> 35:40.680
Quick, say something nice.

35:40.960 --> 35:42.280
Good fortune and blessings.

35:42.400 --> 35:43.840
Good fortune and blessings.

35:48.280 --> 35:49.040
Madam.

35:49.880 --> 35:51.160
Have you ever considered

35:51.400 --> 35:52.680
parting ways with the Lord Gu?

35:53.560 --> 35:54.320
What?

35:55.320 --> 35:56.640
This whole business—

35:56.880 --> 35:58.120
I've thought it through carefully.

35:58.960 --> 35:59.760
On the surface

35:59.760 --> 36:01.160
it looks like Concubine Song and Nanny Zhou

36:01.400 --> 36:02.520
out of jealousy and spite

36:02.840 --> 36:04.400
slipped rhubarb into your medicine.

36:04.840 --> 36:06.360
But the reason they dared do such a thing

36:06.920 --> 36:08.320
is because they could clearly see

36:10.120 --> 36:11.520
that between you and the Lord Gu

36:12.080 --> 36:13.080
there is a rift.

36:15.760 --> 36:16.720
The Lord Gu knew full well

36:17.280 --> 36:18.720
that Concubine Song must have known

36:18.720 --> 36:19.920
what Nanny Zhou was doing.

36:20.400 --> 36:21.880
Yet she received no punishment whatsoever—

36:22.320 --> 36:24.040
merely a cursory brush-off.

36:25.680 --> 36:26.520
It only goes to show

36:27.240 --> 36:28.280
how he feels about you.

36:32.240 --> 36:33.120
What I believe is this—

36:33.720 --> 36:35.400
rather than waste away here in the Gu household

36:36.040 --> 36:37.960
you'd be better off leaving the Master

36:38.720 --> 36:39.880
and returning to Tongzhou.

36:40.320 --> 36:41.960
We can build a good life on our own.

36:42.680 --> 36:44.120
You wouldn't have to keep using your dowry

36:44.320 --> 36:45.040
to support him.

36:45.560 --> 36:46.440
Let them fend for themselves.

36:47.400 --> 36:48.560
Are you suggesting

36:49.960 --> 36:52.280
that I should divorce your father?

36:54.920 --> 36:55.720
No, no, no.

36:57.400 --> 36:58.240
Let me explain.

36:58.240 --> 36:59.160
Say no more.

37:01.160 --> 37:02.200
this is utterly impossible.

37:03.760 --> 37:04.440
Why?

37:05.480 --> 37:06.560
What are you afraid of?

37:06.920 --> 37:08.440
Your grandmother is old.

37:09.640 --> 37:11.080
She couldn't bear something like this.

37:11.600 --> 37:13.120
Grandmother wouldn't mind.

37:13.680 --> 37:14.960
All her life

37:15.560 --> 37:16.480
what she's cared about most

37:17.040 --> 37:18.160
is that you live well.

37:19.040 --> 37:20.520
And what of you and Jinrong?

37:22.280 --> 37:23.080
The two of you—

37:23.280 --> 37:24.680
one unwed, one unbetrothed.

37:25.000 --> 37:25.440
If I

37:25.440 --> 37:27.000
were truly to divorce your father

37:27.200 --> 37:28.320
what would become of the two of you?

37:28.920 --> 37:29.800
Who would be willing to marry

37:29.800 --> 37:31.240
a girl whose mother left her husband?

37:31.240 --> 37:32.160
Take such a girl as a daughter-in-law?

37:32.960 --> 37:33.840
And who would be willing

37:33.840 --> 37:35.320
to marry their fine, respectable daughter

37:35.560 --> 37:37.440
into a household broken by divorce?

37:38.560 --> 37:39.240
No.

37:39.760 --> 37:40.880
It must never happen.

37:42.080 --> 37:43.400
But in this household

37:43.600 --> 37:44.600
you are not happy.

37:45.000 --> 37:46.560
Rong and I see it with our own eyes—

37:47.720 --> 37:49.520
could we possibly

37:49.920 --> 37:50.880
with clear consciences

37:50.880 --> 37:51.960
go off and marry while you suffer?

37:52.680 --> 37:53.960
What sort of people would that make us?

37:54.840 --> 37:56.000
And Grandmother—

37:56.800 --> 37:57.880
that dear old lady—

37:58.080 --> 37:59.320
what worries her most is you.

38:01.160 --> 38:02.880
She gets up in the night, sighing and sighing

38:03.520 --> 38:04.560
unable to rest.

38:05.440 --> 38:06.720
If you agree to a divorce

38:08.080 --> 38:09.800
no one would be happier than she.

38:15.960 --> 38:17.120
To be honest

38:17.920 --> 38:18.920
all I hope

38:19.080 --> 38:20.600
is that you will truly think this over.

38:22.360 --> 38:23.200
Before you were with the Master

38:23.200 --> 38:24.240
what kind of life did you live?

38:24.880 --> 38:26.240
What were those days like?

38:27.440 --> 38:28.320
And now—

38:29.440 --> 38:30.920
what kind of life do you live now?

38:36.040 --> 38:37.160
Not another word.

38:42.640 --> 38:43.160
I will not—

38:43.160 --> 38:44.320
divorce your father.

38:45.720 --> 38:47.760
And besides, your father would never agree to it.

38:48.880 --> 38:50.320
Do not bring this up again.

38:55.640 --> 38:56.280
Molan.

38:56.800 --> 38:57.280
Yes, Madam.

38:57.280 --> 38:58.600
Help me to my bed.

38:58.840 --> 38:59.480
I'm weary.

38:59.480 --> 39:00.360
Yes, Madam.

39:11.400 --> 39:12.440
Is Mrs. Gu  gravely ill?

39:13.080 --> 39:13.480
Yes.

39:14.320 --> 39:15.920
While I was looking into the Mu family's proposal

39:16.320 --> 39:17.560
the Gu household servants told me

39:17.560 --> 39:18.480
that a concubine has been causing trouble—

39:18.800 --> 39:19.360
slipping poison

39:19.360 --> 39:20.280
into Madam Gu's regular medicine.

39:20.800 --> 39:22.000
The household is in complete chaos.

39:22.480 --> 39:23.720
I imagine Miss Gu right now

39:23.720 --> 39:24.720
must be at her wits' end.

39:26.280 --> 39:27.360
This Gu Dezhao

39:27.800 --> 39:29.400
lacking in morals, leaving his house in turmoil—

39:29.400 --> 39:30.600
is hardly fit to hold office at all.

39:31.360 --> 39:32.400
Have the culprits been caught?

39:33.000 --> 39:33.640
They have.

39:33.960 --> 39:34.960
Once the matter came to light

39:35.040 --> 39:36.080
Miss Gu seized them herself.

39:36.560 --> 39:37.560
She had people to call upon, then.

39:38.080 --> 39:39.160
Ye Xian helped her.

39:39.400 --> 39:40.840
He had the culprits taken to the Marquis's residence for interrogation.

39:41.000 --> 39:41.600
Ye Xian.

39:44.000 --> 39:45.200
She turned to Ye Xian for help.

39:45.880 --> 39:46.560
How—

39:47.040 --> 39:48.160
that I do not know, sir.

39:48.800 --> 39:50.240
As for Madam Gu's grave illness—

39:51.200 --> 39:53.240
has a renowned physician been called in to treat her?

39:53.920 --> 39:54.480
Yes.

39:55.120 --> 39:56.480
Ye Xian assisted there as well—

39:56.680 --> 39:57.720
he brought in a divine healer.

40:02.920 --> 40:04.320
Can't handle the brush or the sword

40:04.560 --> 40:05.880
but ever so diligent in matters like these.

40:07.000 --> 40:07.480
Well.

40:08.000 --> 40:08.720
Go

40:09.040 --> 40:10.360
to the residence of Vice Minister Wu of the Ministry of Revenue.

40:10.360 --> 40:10.920
Tell him

40:11.320 --> 40:12.520
I will visit him tomorrow.

40:12.920 --> 40:13.280
Yes.

40:15.000 --> 40:15.560
Wait.

40:17.320 --> 40:17.880
That won't do.

40:19.240 --> 40:21.120
Vice Minister Wu has only recently taken up his post.

40:21.440 --> 40:22.080
Gu Dezhao

40:22.080 --> 40:23.400
is a mere storehouse director—

40:23.520 --> 40:24.200
he likely doesn't even know

40:24.360 --> 40:25.640
what the man looks like.

40:26.520 --> 40:27.960
Better to have the censors impeach him—

40:27.960 --> 40:29.240
cite his corrupt household morals

40:29.320 --> 40:30.240
favoring the concubine over the wife.

40:31.480 --> 40:32.120
That won't do either.

40:32.920 --> 40:33.680
Not that either.

40:34.880 --> 40:37.240
It would harm Jinzhao's reputation.

40:38.080 --> 40:39.800
And if word got out and made a stir

40:40.280 --> 40:41.320
it might also be bad

40:41.320 --> 40:42.280
for Mrs. Gu's condition.

40:44.280 --> 40:45.120
I recall—

40:45.640 --> 40:47.360
Assistant Censor-in-chief Gu Deyuan

40:47.360 --> 40:48.440
is Gu Dezhao's elder brother.

40:50.040 --> 40:50.760
Yes.

40:53.520 --> 40:54.800
No—that won't work either.

40:58.800 --> 41:00.000
It's not right. Not right at all.

41:13.680 --> 41:14.360
Here's what we'll do.

41:14.880 --> 41:16.080
Come with me to the Gu Manor.

41:20.880 --> 41:21.400
What is it?

41:23.360 --> 41:24.040
Nothing.

41:24.960 --> 41:25.840
Then let's go.

41:32.320 --> 41:33.320
It really is Mr. Chen.

41:33.480 --> 41:33.880
It is.

41:34.240 --> 41:35.680
Chen Yi climbed over the wall to find me.

41:35.840 --> 41:37.040
He said to keep it quiet and not disturb the household.

41:44.040 --> 41:44.640
Miss Gu.

41:47.280 --> 41:48.480
Mr. Chen is waiting for you over there.

41:49.280 --> 41:49.960
Come with me.

42:23.600 --> 42:24.880
Greetings, Mr. Chen.

42:27.200 --> 42:28.120
Rise.

42:29.920 --> 42:30.760
Between us

42:31.280 --> 42:32.240
here's no need for such formalities.

42:35.480 --> 42:36.680
What's happened in your household—

42:37.640 --> 42:38.680
I've heard something of it.

42:45.040 --> 42:46.120
Take this.

42:47.320 --> 42:48.440
What is it?

42:55.200 --> 42:56.160
Among those who serve under me

42:56.560 --> 42:57.240
there are many

42:57.320 --> 42:58.880
who have been at my side for years.

42:59.600 --> 43:00.880
Most of them are quite skilled.

43:02.680 --> 43:04.040
If you ever find yourself in danger again

43:04.560 --> 43:05.960
just blow on this whistle.

43:38.200 --> 43:39.160
The day after tomorrow

43:40.000 --> 43:40.760
at the Dragon Boat Festival

43:42.120 --> 43:43.280
I will be at Baoxiang Temple.

43:47.440 --> 43:48.920
[He treats me so kindly—]

43:49.200 --> 43:50.760
[what does it truly mean?]
